  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'd like to recommend the ability to from the sdk or website allow us to rename an avatar, to change the thumbnail of it, or update the description without having to re-upload them. This could be useful for small tweaks like updated naming conventions for organization or updated thumbnail in the case of users who provide information on thumbnails like websites or information of the original creator.\nIf users no longer have the original files they'd be no longer able to update this information given the current system which for an avatar world creator can become a hassle keeping track of all the files.",
